.research/260212_field-alias-compression-study.md:113:Designed a three-level comprehension benchmark to measure whether abbreviated field names degrade LLM accuracy:
.research/260212_field-alias-compression-study.md:126:Evaluated by Claude Opus 4.6 with pre-computed ground truth verified independently by positional field counting.
.research/260212_field-alias-compression-study.md:132:| 1 | 5 | 10/10 (100%) | 10/10 (100%) | 0% |
